  "description": "Hiri is not cool, a timid and pathetic adult. She’s good at cursing, is childish, and she’s so honest about her feelings that she cries, gets angry, and forgets. But that’s just her as she is. What’s wrong with that? “Hiriwiri” is a combination of “Hiri” and “Wuri(us in Korean)”. Everyone has a pathetic charm like Hiri. Hiriwiri Drawing-Toon, please look forward to it passively.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://page.kakao.com/content/54108229)",
